{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey, do you know? The rumors about the disappearing people in Saooni village...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep the news club alive,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mako&quot; and &quot;Akane&quot; head to a village to collect information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village is holding a strange festival, and they are caught up in a series of events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the girls make it out of this monster-infested village alive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror game focused on escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of two female protagonists as they try to escape from the village of Saooni.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saooni and villagers lurk in the village, and being spotted will result in an immediate Game Over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay emphasizes stealth and exploration \u2014 collect items, avoid enemies, and find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779890?t=1757642320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779890/28481b6d5cd5d705ce36e609e0858ced0d9916e7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757642320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779890/c9a98266ef59b6d0b717d8447221d2705eeceb73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757642320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779890/c9a98266ef59b6d0b717d8447221d2705eeceb73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757642320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey, do you know? The rumors about the disappearing people in Saooni village...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep the news club alive,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mako&quot; and &quot;Akane&quot; head to a village to collect information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village is holding a strange festival, and they are caught up in a series of events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the girls make it out of this monster-infested village alive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror game focused on escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of two female protagonists as they try to escape from the village of Saooni.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saooni and villagers lurk in the village, and being spotted will result in an immediate Game Over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay emphasizes stealth and exploration \u2014 collect items, avoid enemies, and find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u305f\u307e\u305f\u307e\u5c71\u8108"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779890/1566f1f9be37943724264350df004962da8faef5/header.jpg?t=1757642320","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Spiriting Away of Saooni Village","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows\u00ae 7/8/8.1/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2+ GHz Processor<br></li><li><st